  "zh": "# 中国AI偶像事件引热议，OpenAI优化Codex Roadster成焦点\n## AI 热点\n- **AI偶像怀孕事件**：该虚拟偶像怀孕新闻引发全网热议，凸显AI内容生成的真实感与争议。\n- **OpenAI Codex优化**：Codex能力提升将加速代码自动生成，对开发者效率影响显著。\n## 产品技术\n- **特斯拉Roadster飞行**：视频解释其喷射推进技术，展示未来汽车可能的新形态。\n- **李宏毅机器学习直播**：知名学者李宏毅在B站开设机器学习公开课，吸引大量学习者。\n- **Llama.cpp PS5**：展示大语言模型在游戏主机上的本地推理可能性，降低云端依赖。\n## 行业动向\n- **美国工作时间AI基准覆盖**：研究表明当前AI基准未能反映真实工作场景，提示评估体系需更新。\n- **Waymo测试**：Waymo在多伦多开展道路测试，表明自动驾驶商业化步伐加快。\n- **苹果MLX分布式推理**：苹果发布基于MLX的分布式推理框架，提升Mac Studio上的AI算力。",
  "en": "# AI idol scandal sparks buzz as OpenAI refines Codex and Tesla Roadster tech draws attention\n## AI Highlights\n- **AI idol pregnancy**：The virtual idol’s fake pregnancy stunt ignited online debate, highlighting AI‑generated realism and its controversies.\n- **Codex upgrade**：Codex’s enhanced capabilities will speed up automated code generation, noticeably boosting developer productivity.\n## Product Tech\n- **Roadster flight**：The video explains its jet‑propulsion stunt, showing a possible future car form.\n- **Li Hongyi ML**：Renowned scholar Li Hongyi’s B‑station machine‑learning lecture draws a large online audience.\n- **Llama.cpp on PS5**：Running Llama.cpp on a PS5 shows LLMs can run locally on consoles, cutting cloud reliance.\n## Industry Moves\n- **AI benchmark gap**：Study finds current AI benchmarks miss most real‑world tasks, calling for better evaluation.\n- **Waymo testing**：Waymo’s road tests in Toronto signal accelerating commercialization of self‑driving tech.\n- **MLX inference**：Apple’s MLX framework brings distributed AI inference to Mac Studio, boosting on‑device power."
